{"availability":"available","full":"realAllenSong/ThunderTalk","name":"ThunderTalk","description":"🎙️ Free, open-source local voice toolkit for macOS (Apple Silicon): hotkey dictation in any app, file transcription with speaker labels, and text-to-speech with voice cloning (VoxCPM2, IndexTTS-2.5, Kokoro). 100% on-device. Chinese, English and mixed speech.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":9,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-13T04:00:43Z","updated":"2026-10-07T01:40:45Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://realallensong.github.io/ThunderTalk/","topics":["apple-silicon","asr","diarization","dictation","macos","macos-app","mlx","offline","privacy","productivity","qwen","sensevoice","speech-recognition","speech-to-text","text-to-speech","transcription","translation","voice-cloning","voice-to-text","voice-typing"],"demo":"https://realallensong.github.io/ThunderTalk/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:17.417Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:17.417Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T09:02:17.417Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T09:02:17.417Z","stars":9,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Press a key, speak, and the text appears at your cursor.","Speech recognition runs on your own Mac: no account, no subscription, no cloud.","The recording bar and Studio screens are the app's own interface (the email window is a stand-in). The dictated sentence, the meeting transcript and the speech are real model output on an M3 Max; only the pacing is scripted."],"features":["One global hotkey that works in any app. The default is Right ⌘; choose Toggle (press to start, press to stop) or Hold in Settings, and change the key or combination there too.","Live Preview: read provisional text in the floating recording bar while you speak. Settings ▸ Live Preview is on by default. Words can change as you continue; stopping triggers full-clip recognition for the final pasted…","S